[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Version=1.0
Name=政务工作记录台
GenericName=工作记录与荣誉档案
Comment=本机离线使用的工作记录、进展与荣誉档案管理
Exec=@@BIN@@/civic-work-desk
Icon=@@PREFIX@@/current/app/icons/icon-512.png
Terminal=false
StartupNotify=false
Categories=Office;ProjectManagement;
Keywords=工作记录;台账;荣誉;报表;CivicWorkDesk;
# Template. install.sh replaces the two placeholders with absolute paths and refuses to finish if
# either survives. Rationale for the substitution, the absolute Exec and the absence of a named
# browser is in install.sh section 7 — deliberately not repeated here, because the installer rewrites
# this file and a comment that described the placeholders had its own placeholders substituted,
# leaving the installed entry claiming that two absolute paths "are substituted by install.sh".
